        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a haunted loop at a forgotten three-way junction—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find what’s wrong before the night consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/9fd888b84fdb8bf095cc0448b255bf7b.poster.avif?t=1766366195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/9fd888b84fdb8bf095cc0448b255bf7b.webm?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/9fd888b84fdb8bf095cc0448b255bf7b.mp4?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tong is heading home after an exhausting night shift,<br>but as he passes the old three-way junction,<br>he suddenly becomes trapped in a strange, endless loop.<br>Now he must find a way to break free… before the night consumes him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must explore and memorize the map,<br>searching for anything that feels out of place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an anomaly is found, they must enter the tunnel marked with a red sign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/b0e0e4f8e72235e1d12ec8ba0b628057.poster.avif?t=1766366195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/b0e0e4f8e72235e1d12ec8ba0b628057.webm?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/b0e0e4f8e72235e1d12ec8ba0b628057.mp4?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If nothing is wrong, they must take the tunnel with the green sign instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/59f3004a1bec9d5d8df046213357adb8.poster.avif?t=1766366195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/59f3004a1bec9d5d8df046213357adb8.webm?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/59f3004a1bec9d5d8df046213357adb8.mp4?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn 10 points by choosing correctly,<br>and only then can they escape the strange loop that traps them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for 30 to 60 minutes of play per run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve got a phone, right? Just put on some music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/f9b227286d6d75b7edd6bd67a2765e05.poster.avif?t=1766366195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/f9b227286d6d75b7edd6bd67a2765e05.webm?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/f9b227286d6d75b7edd6bd67a2765e05.mp4?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a haunted loop at a forgotten three-way junction—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find what’s wrong before the night consumes you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/9fd888b84fdb8bf095cc0448b255bf7b.poster.avif?t=1766366195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/9fd888b84fdb8bf095cc0448b255bf7b.webm?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/9fd888b84fdb8bf095cc0448b255bf7b.mp4?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tong is heading home after an exhausting night shift,<br>but as he passes the old three-way junction,<br>he suddenly becomes trapped in a strange, endless loop.<br>Now he must find a way to break free… before the night consumes him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must explore and memorize the map,<br>searching for anything that feels out of place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an anomaly is found, they must enter the tunnel marked with a red sign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/b0e0e4f8e72235e1d12ec8ba0b628057.poster.avif?t=1766366195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/b0e0e4f8e72235e1d12ec8ba0b628057.webm?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/b0e0e4f8e72235e1d12ec8ba0b628057.mp4?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If nothing is wrong, they must take the tunnel with the green sign instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/59f3004a1bec9d5d8df046213357adb8.poster.avif?t=1766366195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/59f3004a1bec9d5d8df046213357adb8.webm?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/59f3004a1bec9d5d8df046213357adb8.mp4?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn 10 points by choosing correctly,<br>and only then can they escape the strange loop that traps them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for 30 to 60 minutes of play per run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve got a phone, right? Just put on some music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/f9b227286d6d75b7edd6bd67a2765e05.poster.avif?t=1766366195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/f9b227286d6d75b7edd6bd67a2765e05.webm?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221770/extras/f9b227286d6d75b7edd6bd67a2765e05.mp4?t=1766366195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
